+## Publication policy
+
+Create no tag, draft or public Release without a new explicit user request.
+Web previews and ordinary PR merges are separate from desktop publication.
+Future download lists expose installers only; keep required updater metadata,
+and retain CI/signing reports in Actions evidence. Do not rewrite Beta2 assets.
+
+## Signed Beta2 publication — 2026-11-01
+
+[Beta2](https://github.com/umaxzhao/voo-design/releases/tag/v1.0.0-beta.2)
+is public as a prerelease, not the latest stable release. Its immutable source is
+[`ae85951`](https://github.com/umaxzhao/voo-design/commit/ae85951133f38d2fe3b15e39cd7f58015c073238).
+The [complete release gate](https://github.com/umaxzhao/voo-design/actions/runs/41314772574)
+passed 105/105 steps, 101 core browser suites, 4,851 unit tests (4 skipped),
+1,447 design files and four native packaged-app targets. Eleven standalone
+suites remain not-run; functional coverage remains partial (12 modules/93 groups).
+
+The [separate signing gate](https://github.com/umaxzhao/voo-run/actions/runs/41314779042)
+passed for Intel and Apple Silicon using the existing approved signing store.
+Actual DMG and ZIP app contents passed Developer ID/team, Hardened Runtime,
+notarization, stapling, Gatekeeper and original ASAR checks. Both bundles declare
+macOS 12+. Windows setup/portable PE certificate tables are absent: unsigned.
+
+All seven anonymous public installer URLs return HTTP 200 with expected sizes.
+Twenty-four asset SHA-256 entries match GitHub's server digests, including three
+update manifests, four native receipts and two signing receipts. Small metadata
+files were also downloaded and hashed. The large payloads were verified before
+upload; the public check did not download every large payload again. The same
+source Web build is deployed to [the editor](https://voo.run/editor/); four actual
+production groups pass with 83 loaded JS/CSS hashes matching and zero page errors.
+
+Manual installation/system prompts, old-version upgrade, live paid/CLI/model
+services and other OS versions remain unverified. This is not an exhaustive
+product certification. Fixed-revision evidence and local receipts are indexed in
+[quality-progress.md](quality-progress.md). Documentation follow-ups do not
+change the binary source. Beta1 below remains a separate historical release.
+
+## Desktop prerelease implementation — 2026-11-01
+
+Candidate version: `1.0.0-beta.1`. Initial audit at `ed3db20` found no tags,
+releases, release-workflow runs or configured signing secrets. Only secret
+names were inspected, never values. Historical checked boxes remain historical.
+
+The new workflow builds Windows x64 setup/portable, Linux x64 AppImage and Mac
+Intel/Apple Silicon DMG/ZIP on four native runners. Run with `create_draft=true`
+to assemble a draft only after the full Web gate and every native job succeed. It checks ASAR runtime
+assets/transitive dependencies, connector resources, locale resources, packaged
+startup, real pointer drawing/history, native workspace I/O, cancellation of
+dirty quit while retaining the bridge, and fresh-process project opening.
+The native OS picker/confirmation choices are automated, not manually tested.
+
+The assembly step requires four matching-version/commit smoke receipts,
+checks every update payload hash/size, merges both Mac metadata files and adds
+checksums. Native screenshots/receipts and the Web gate report/browser evidence are retained as CI artifacts. Unsigned
+previews and remaining trust/installer/service/upgrade contexts are disclosed.
+No workflow automatically publishes a stable release or overwrites an existing
+one. Current execution/revision is maintained in [quality-progress.md](quality-progress.md).
+
+Verified candidate: [`eab3bea`](https://github.com/umaxzhao/voo-design/commit/eab3beaaff22a2ccc28780d9972bb2c58f4baa78).
+[The complete run](https://github.com/umaxzhao/voo-design/actions/runs/41281003764)
+passed 105/105 steps, 101 core browser suites, 4,781 unit tests (4 skipped), design
+checks and all four native targets. The reviewed draft contains seven payloads,
+three update manifests and four matching receipts. Its 21 checksummed assets,
+including release notes and the full Web report, match GitHub's server digests.
+The [Beta page](https://github.com/umaxzhao/voo-design/releases/tag/v1.0.0-beta.1)
+is the authority for publication status. Packages remain unsigned/not notarized;
+manual installation, OS trust, older-version upgrades and live services remain
+unverified. Eleven additional suites remain not-run; coverage remains partial.
+Documentation-only follow-ups do not change the recorded binary source revision.
 
